              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 10:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Yehu yaashohora, yaagaruka aha bashaija ba mukama we, baamubuuza bati: Ni buhooro? Ogwo mushaija omugwairaro yaaba areetsirwe ki ahariiwe? Yaabagarukamu ati: Ogwo mushaija nimumumanya n'ebigambo bye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baagira bati: Ngaaha, noobeiha; tugambire amazima. Onu ati: Yaagamba naanye naagira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Naakushukaho amajuta kuba omugabe wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.21.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 21:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Batyo baarahuka, buri muntu yaakwata ekijwaro kye, baabyara ahansi ye aha mutwe gw'amatembero, baateera eikondere nibagira bati: Yehu yaaba omugabe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
