              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 22:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahazia omugabe wa Yuda ku yaakireebire, yaahungira omu muhanda ogurikuza Besi-hagani. Yehu yaamubinga, naagira ati: Nawe mumurashe. Baamurasira omu kigaari kye yaahika aharikweinamuka Guuri, eri haihi na Ibuleamu. Yaahungira Megido, yaagwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagaragwa be baamuta omu kigaari, baamutwara Yerusaalemu, baamuziika omu kituuro omu rurembo rwa Daudi, baamushangisa baishenkuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omu mwaka gwa ikumi na gumwe ogw'omu busingye bwa Yoramu mwene Ahabu, Ahazia akatandika kutegyeka Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu ku yaahikire Yezereeli, Yezebeeli yaakihurira, yaaziga amaisho ge, yaaboneza eishokye rye, yaaringuririza omu dirisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.16.9+1KI.16.10+1KI.16.11+1KI.16.12+1KI.16.13+1KI.16.14+1KI.16.15+1KI.16.16+1KI.16.17+1KI.16.18+1KI.16.19+1KI.16.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 16:9-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yehu ku yaabaire yaahika ati omu rurembo, Yezebeeli yaamugira ati: Iwe Zimuri, owaita mukama waawe, ni buhooro? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu yaimutsya amaisho, yaareeba omu dirisa, yaagira ati: Ori aha rubaju rwangye n'oha? N'oha? Abakonwa bashatu nari babiri baamuringuriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaabagira ati: Mumunagye ahansi. Batyo baamunaga ahansi, eshagama ye yaataraakira ekisiika n'embaraasi, zaamuribatiirira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.16.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 16:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yehu yaataaha omu nju, yaarya, yaanywa; bwanyima yaagira ati: Mwirooko mureebe ogwo mukazi okyeenirwe, mumuziikye, ahakuba ni muhara w'omugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka ku baagiire kumuziika, tibaamushangaho, kureka empanga y'omutwe gwe n'ebigyere n'ebiganja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.21.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 21:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku baagarukire, baamugambira, yaagira ati: Ekyo nikyo kigambo kya MUKAMA, eki yaagambire naaraba omu mwiru we Eliya owa Tishubi, ati: Omu musiri gwa Yezereeli nimwo embwa ziririira omutumbi gwa Yezebeeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi omutumbi gwe guryaba nk'amasha agari ahansi omu musiri gwa Yezereeli, habure owaagira ati: Ogu ni Yezebeeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
